{
	"_comment": "Models & rules (J5): match models a steward creates per domain, each with its own match rules and change request duplicate check. In the product these are versioned configuration served by the rules API and run by the services (Splink for matching, the request service for the duplicate check); the console only edits drafts. Sample values only. Fields come from the columns of the model's repository (repoColumns: the staged table, including the columns the standardise step derives).",
